      "heading": "About the pronunciations",
      "text": [
        "Pronunciations follow standard Copenhagen Danish, written as exact (bracketed) IPA. ˀ marks the stød, a creaky catch in the voice that can tell words apart (hun \"she\" vs hund \"dog\"). b, d, g are pronounced as unaspirated p, t, k, which is how they appear in the IPA."
      ]
